{"title":"Weld Pigment","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Herblore Lv 15)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Herblore at level 15 <span class=\"muted\">(60 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/weld-stalks\">Weld Stalks</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/herblore\">Herblore</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/scribing\">Scribing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/weld-stalks\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e546662c1db73944815a.svg\" alt=\"\">Weld Stalks</a></p>\n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/weld-binding-rune\">Weld Binding Rune</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 35</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/exp-scroll-combat\">Combat XP Scroll</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 25</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/exp-scroll-gathering\">Gathering XP Scroll</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 25</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/exp-scroll-crafting\">Crafting XP Scroll</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 25</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/967f6873fe86bccaf486.svg\" alt=\"Weld Pigment\"></div><h3>Weld Pigment</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Herblore 15</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>4 recipes</td></tr>\n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}